{{!--
    Splash — the loudest rung of the arrival sting (design/theatre-of-the-mind-
    staging.md §5). A full-screen character introduction: portrait duotoned to
    monochrome (always — no faction wash on the art itself, see
    bi-components.css's .bi-splash__art img comment), name in the display
    register carrying the faction accent, an affiliation line, a plain
    decorative seal, and a dismiss hint.

    Must render exactly ONE top-level element — this isn't rendered through
    ApplicationV2's PARTS system, but tier0-architecture.test.mjs's lint scans
    every .hbs regardless, and one root is the right shape either way.

    NO invented content: no Japanese seal text, no standing/rank line beyond
    what a portrait hand-authors. `.bi-splash__seal` is a plain ring — the
    campaign's stamped-ink visual vocabulary (`.bi-stamp`'s rotation and
    multiply-blend) without inventing words to put inside it.

    --splash-accent is set here, conditionally, from accentToken (a CSS
    custom-property NAME like "--bi-vermilion", not a colour value) — when
    accentToken is null this property is never set at all, and every rule in
    bi-components.css that reads var(--splash-accent, ...) falls back to its
    own monochrome default, which is what makes one CSS path serve both cases.
--}}
<div class="bi-splash"{{#if accentToken}} style="--splash-accent: var({{accentToken}});"{{/if}}>
    <div class="bi-splash__scrim"></div>
    <div class="bi-splash__art">
        {{#if img}}<img src="{{img}}" alt="">{{/if}}
    </div>
    <div class="bi-splash__type">
        {{!-- data-text duplicates {{label}} for the oversized ghost echo behind
              it (bi-components.css's attr(data-text) rule) -- the SAME real
              string rendered twice at different scales, not new content. --}}
        <p class="bi-splash__name" data-text="{{label}}">{{label}}</p>
        {{#if affiliationLabel}}<p class="bi-splash__subtitle">{{affiliationLabel}}</p>{{/if}}
    </div>
    <div class="bi-splash__seal" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <p class="bi-splash__hint">{{localize "BLANKINHERITANCE.Splash.DismissHint"}}</p>
</div>
